@startuml
actor User
boundary View as MAUIView
control ViewModel as ReportIncidentVM
control HttpClient
entity "API Controller\n(IncidentController)" as ApiController
database "Database\n(PingItDbContext)" as Db

User -> MAUIView : Tap "Submit Report"
MAUIView -> ReportIncidentVM : SendCommand.Execute()
activate ReportIncidentVM

alt Missing Required Fields
    ReportIncidentVM -> MAUIView : Display alert
    deactivate ReportIncidentVM
    return
end

ReportIncidentVM -> ReportIncidentVM : Construct IncidentDto
note right of ReportIncidentVM : Title, Description, Lat, Long, UserId

ReportIncidentVM -> HttpClient : POST api/incident
activate HttpClient

HttpClient -> ApiController : POST api/incident
activate ApiController
ApiController -> Db : Add Incident\n+ SaveChanges
Db --> ApiController : Incident w/ Id
ApiController -> ApiController : Load Photos (empty)
ApiController --> HttpClient : Created IncidentDto
deactivate ApiController
HttpClient --> ReportIncidentVM : Response (IncidentDto w/ Id)
deactivate HttpClient

loop for each Photo
    ReportIncidentVM -> HttpClient : POST api/incident/{id}/photos
    HttpClient -> ApiController : POST incident photo
    ApiController -> Db : Save IncidentPhoto
    Db --> ApiController
    ApiController --> HttpClient : Response
end

ReportIncidentVM -> MAUIView : Display Success Message
ReportIncidentVM -> ReportIncidentVM : ClearFormAsync()
ReportIncidentVM -> MAUIView : Navigate Back
deactivate ReportIncidentVM
@enduml